  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifccm-Capability">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifccm:Capability</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0020-ifccm FR-001</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>Examined: the ArchiMate and UAF 'capability' elements (an ability of an organization or system, as here) and ISO/IEC/IEEE 15288 and 12207 (system capability); none publishes an IRI, and Spec Kit's 'feature' is the term this one replaces. Candidates to examine further: a published ArchiMate or UAF vocabulary (to verify). Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005).</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifccm#Capability</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
